# Theme & design

Source of truth: **`Design.md`**. Tokens live in `utils/theme.js`, `globals.css`, and Theme Customizer (`utils/themeCustomizer.js`).

## CRM app chrome
- Use `const { colors, theme, scheme } = useTheme()`
- Surfaces/text/borders: `colors.primaryBackground`, `colors.foreground`, `colors.border`, `colors.mutedForeground`, etc.
- Accents: `scheme.primary` / CSS `hsl(var(--primary))` — **do not** hard-code one brand hue in feature modules
- Density: bordered cards, `rounded-xl` / `rounded-2xl`, high information density

## Marketing / Agency
- `app/AgencySite/` uses `AgencyThemeContext` + `disableLayout`
- Keep agency sales copy separate from in-app CRM modules
- Orphan note: `app/LandingPage/` exists but `/` uses AgencySite — do not wire both without intent

## Motion & icons
- Framer Motion for shell panels; keep transitions short
- Lucide for app chrome; `react-icons` for brand marks (e.g. Scheduler platforms)
